doc:sch-1-sec-23a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23A(1) Citizenship test" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must, by written determination, approve a test for the purposes of subsection 21(2A) (about general eligibility for citizenship).  Amendments  Schedule 1  Note: The test must be related to the eligibility criteria referred to in paragraphs 21(2)(d), (e) and (f). Successful completion of the test" ;
