concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007-sch-1-sec-23a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23A(4) Citizenship test"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-23a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), the determination may provide that a person is not eligible to sit the test unless the person is a permanent resident and the Minister is satisfied of the identity of the person." ;
