concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007-sch-1-sec-23a-ss-4 cml:asserts concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007-sch-1-sec-23a-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4 .
