    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:  (a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or  (b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a determination under section 23A; the following persons may request the person, in writing, to provide one or more specified personal identifiers:  (c) the Minister;  (d) a person authorised under subsection (3);  Schedule 1  Amendments  (e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised under subsection (4)." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:  (a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or  (b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a determination under section 23A; the following persons may request the person, in writing, to provide one or more specified personal identifiers:  (c) the Minister;  (d) a person authorised under subsection (3);  Schedule 1  Amendments  (e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised under subsection (4)."@en ;
