concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007-sch-1-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Transitional"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a request was made under subsection 40(1) of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 before the commencement of this item; and  (b) the request had not been complied with before that commencement; the request has effect after that commencement as if it were a request made under that subsection after that commencement.  Amendments  Schedule 1  (2) An authorisation in force under subsection 40(3) or (4) of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 immediately before the commencement of this item has effect after that commencement as if it were an authorisation made under that subsection immediately after that commencement.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 30 May 2007 Senate on 8 August 2007]  (103/07)" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) a request was made under subsection 40(1) of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 before the commencement of this item; and  (b) the request had not been complied with before that commencement; the request has effect after that commencement as if it were a request made under that subsection after that commencement.  Amendments  Schedule 1  (2) An authorisation in force under subsection 40(3) or (4) of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 immediately before the commencement of this item has effect after that commencement as if it were an authorisation made under that subsection immediately after that commencement.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 30 May 2007 Senate on 8 August 2007]  (103/07)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ac04226fbb77aa751ec365256c08e2995c190ab26bada1a2732ae56cd31413a0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Preserves effect of requests and authorizations made before commencement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007.pdf, p.10" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007-sch-1-sec-13-norm .
